Depends: jujue (>= 0.2.0-1), iagent (>= 1.0.0-1), ss-webos (>= 2.0.0-12), mdesk (>= 3.0.0-6), uchat (>= 2.0.0-3), agent-sphere (>= 0.2.0-1), agent-ultra (>= 0.1.0-1)
Description: Agent Sphere user application composition
 Composes Jujue, iAgent, WebOS, desktop and chat applications with
 the separately owned Agent Sphere core and local Agent Ultra infrastructure.
 This metapackage contains documentation only. Native application release
 artifacts and owner configuration are required before activation.
